<li>1730warning.png, bleed.jpg, classified2.png, graph.jpg, writing.jpg, and camera.jpg, are all original works of my own, released under CC.</li>
<li>exploration.jpg is <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Defense.gov_photo_essay_080605-F-3798Y-294.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Defense.gov_photo_essay_080605-F-3798Y-294.jpg</a>, and is public domain.</li>
